OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud will
OL,6,Fcontinue to creep in through the
OL,7,Fevening and into the night, keeping
OL,8,Ftemperatures in double figures so
OL,9,Ffeeling mild. It will stay dry through
OL,10,Fthe night and winds will drop to a
OL,11,Fgentle breeze. Fog patches in south.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FStaying dry on Monday but
OL,14,Flargely cloudy. Some bright spells are
OL,15,Flikely to form through the day.
OL,16,FFeeling pleasantly warm in any
OL,17,Fafternoon sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
