OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fskies on Tuesday with showery
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain across the region.
OL,8,FSpells of rain persisting through
OL,9,FWednesday, then turning cooler and
OL,10,Fbrighter with sunny spells.
